                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">各位教工：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">依法纳税是所有公民的应尽义务。根据国家税务总局《关于办理<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年度个人所得税综合所得汇算清缴事项的公告》的精神，<SPAN lang=EN-US>2020</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>日前要进行<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年度最后一次个税申报，之后在<SPAN lang=EN-US>2020</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>-6</SPAN>月进行汇算清缴。汇算清缴是汇总<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日至<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>31</SPAN>日取得的<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><U>所有应发收入</U></B>（以下称“综合所得”），减除社保公积金、专项附加扣除等纳税扣除部分，计算本年度最终应纳税额。对应纳税额减去<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年度已预缴税额的差额进行多退少补。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">根据公告：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast" lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>月个税可分为<B><U>综合所得</U></B>和<B><U>一次性奖金</U></B>两部分进行申报缴税（在<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>日上报），纳税人可以选择收入中的<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><U>一笔</U></B>奖金（如<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><U><SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>月发的</U></B>年终奖和高考奖二选一）作为一次性奖金进行申报，其余所有收入合并作为综合所得申报。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">例：某教工<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>月共发放年终奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>34000</SPAN>元，其余所有收入<SPAN lang=EN-US>100000</SPAN>元（其中包括<SPAN lang=EN-US>1-11</SPAN>月预发年终奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>26000</SPAN>元），高考奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>20000</SPAN>元。不考虑专项附加扣除等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">·最优个税方案：<SPAN lang=EN-US>34000</SPAN>元以<B><U>一次性奖金</U></B>申报，其余收入共<SPAN lang=EN-US>120000</SPAN>元以<B><U>综合所得</U></B>申报，应缴个税为<SPAN lang=EN-US>10500</SPAN>元。没有高考奖的教工为<SPAN lang=EN-US>8500</SPAN>元。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">·不申报年终奖的方案：高考奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>20000</SPAN>元以<B><U>一次性奖金</U></B>申报，扣除年终奖的剩余<SPAN lang=EN-US>74000</SPAN>元以<B><U>综合所得</U></B>申报，应缴个税<SPAN lang=EN-US>5480</SPAN>元。没有高考奖的教工则只能浪费一次性奖金申报机会，<SPAN lang=EN-US>74000</SPAN>元以<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><U>综合所得</U></B>申报个税<SPAN lang=EN-US>4880</SPAN>元。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">注意：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=MsoListParagraph><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-fareast" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">1.<SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'">  </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">汇算清缴<B><U>只重新汇总计算综合所得</U></B>，<B>无法改变已经作为一次性奖金申报的部分收入</B>。大部分教工都是把年终奖申报为一次性奖金纳税最少。若本次不申报<B><U>一次性奖金</U></B>，<B><U>在汇算清缴时无法再把年终奖申报为一次性奖金，</U></B>只能并入综合所得纳税。在汇算清缴中<B><U>补缴年终奖个税则个税为<SPAN lang=EN-US>11480</SPAN>元，没有高考奖的教工为<SPAN lang=EN-US>10880</SPAN>元。</U></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 38.95pt; mso-para-margin-left: 3.71gd" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">虽然本次不申报年终奖可以少交个税，但补缴时需要缴纳比正常申报更多的个税！（举例中多交<SPAN lang=EN-US>980</SPAN>元，没有高考奖的教工多交<SPAN lang=EN-US>2340</SPAN>元。如果收入更高，多交的会更多）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=MsoListParagraph><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-fareast" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">2.<SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'">  </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">综合所得不到<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>万元的纳税人，无需汇算清缴。不申报年终奖，许多低收入的教工综合收入不到<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>万元，没有在汇算清缴中多退少补的资格，无法补缴年终奖部分税款。另外会<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><U>导致收入证明的收入较低，可能影响签证、房贷</U></B>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">现在做出不交税的决定可能无法在汇算清缴时进行弥补，并产生后续影响！<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 39pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=MsoListParagraph><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">3.<SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'">  </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast" lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">年是个税实行新政策第一年，不能以老的经验认为个税不会被检查。个税政策已写明：收入数据由个人提供给单位，单位进行代扣代缴。因此纳税检查更针对个人，不针对整个单位。单位无法替职工承担未依法纳税的责任（单位未依法扣缴的情况除外）。若被查到未依法纳税，需要补交<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><U>税款及滞纳金，并罚款</U></B>。同时，发改委在<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年已发布<SPAN class=dhgao2>个人所得税纳税信用建设的通知，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">建立了个人所得税信用管理机制</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">与<SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">激励惩戒机制。纳税人被记录有失信行为会导致<B><U>社会生活中面临各种限制</U></B>。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">我校考虑到上述注意点和风险点，根据政策精神，请各位教工<B><U>自行选择是否要把年终奖申报个税</U></B>。请在<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>13</SPAN>日下班前通过钉钉或<SPAN lang=EN-US>QQ</SPAN>等方式，把“<B><U>申报年终奖个税</U></B>”或“<B><U>不申报年终奖个税</U></B>”发给财务室宋弘韬，纳税方案选择和申报工作由财务室完成。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">如果你不想把学校发放的收入作为<B><U>一次性奖金</U></B><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">申报</SPAN>，请联系财务室说明。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">逾期<B><U>未选择</U></B>申报方式，则默认为由单位<B><U>申报年终奖个税</U></B>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">特此通知，感谢您的配合和理解。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">联系电话：宋：<SPAN lang=EN-US>18057579602</SPAN>，徐：<SPAN lang=EN-US>18167368075</SPAN>，张：<SPAN lang=EN-US>18006752007<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">请各位教工相互转告！</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast"></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p>                                                       </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 360pt; MARGIN: 0cm 24pt 0pt 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 30.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">                        财务室<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
